Base: pinned 3cf03257 plus Strata patches 0001..0005.
Not exact against q8_1: one fp32 scale per 128 values, int16 sums of quantized values per 32.
Arithmetic port keeps the owner loop order; signatures adapted to pinned ggml (no prec_src1).
Compile GGML_CUDA_MMQ_Q8K; runtime STRATA_MMQ_Q8K=1 opts in only on RDNA2.
Both activation layouts have distinct template specializations; the default q8_1 path stays present.

